  "goodToKnow": "Die Unterlassung is an omission or failure to act. In German law, unterlassene Hilfeleistung (§323c StGB), failing to help in an emergency, is a crime, which is why bystanders must at least call 112. A lawyer's Abmahnung often demands a strafbewehrte Unterlassungserklärung, a binding promise to stop an infringement. Unterlassen means to refrain from: Bitte unterlassen Sie das Rauchen. Plural: die Unterlassungen."
